Welcome to the network!
=======================

What is the network?
--------------------
The network is a CTF challenge in a somewhat unconventional format. In this 
challenge you are a sentient piece of data that, when you log in, find yourself
in the outskirts of an unknown network. Somewhere in the network is the FLAG
and you need to find it.

How does it work?
-----------------
You don't have much information, and you need to work a lot of things out for
yourself. This network does resemble a TCP/IP network, but there are some 
slight, and some major, deviations here and there.

You will need to figure out how to traverse the network, how to follow the 
rules and how to get past obstacles that you might face.

Good luck!